# Ship staging → main

When the user asks to **ship**, **release staging**, or **merge staging to main**, read and follow [`.cursor/skills/ship-staging/SKILL.md`](../skills/ship-staging/SKILL.md).

For review-only PRs (no merge), use the `open-pr` skill instead.

Do **not** run unless the user explicitly requests it.
